      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "지난 경기 이겼잖아요!\n오늘 저녁은 좀 쉬어도 돼요?",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "We won last match!\nCan we take it easy tonight?",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "41fa507b-e84e-57e4-981d-5da39ced475f",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "면담 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "nodeId": "14277d05-17b7-5f53-8855-52ca9c0f8348"
        }
